00:26:49.899 --> 00:26:51.109
Works

281
00:26:55.572 --> 00:26:56.531
Not anymore.

282
00:26:57.115 --> 00:26:58.533
I think you need much more.

283
00:26:59.326 --> 00:27:00.535
But...

284
00:27:00.618 --> 00:27:02.120
It became much easier to breathe.

285
00:27:02.203 --> 00:27:04.914
The more you charge,
then you should be getting better.

286
00:27:16.468 --> 00:27:17.427
I have to go to work.

287
00:27:19.763 --> 00:27:21.014
Can you take a day off?

288
00:27:21.097 --> 00:27:22.474
- No.
- Absolutely not?

289
00:27:23.058 --> 00:27:24.934
But you are the general director.

290
00:27:25.018 --> 00:27:27.395
Will you celebrate my survival
announcing today…

291
00:27:28.104 --> 00:27:29.439
company anniversary?

292
00:27:31.399 --> 00:27:32.484
rest

293
00:27:35.403 --> 00:27:36.696
Then only five more minutes.

294
00:27:37.614 --> 00:27:39.282
Let me recharge a little more.

295
00:27:55.840 --> 00:27:59.094
Yesterday was total chaos.

296
00:27:59.677 --> 00:28:00.970
For world peace

297
00:28:02.305 --> 00:28:03.348
let's make up

298
00:28:03.431 --> 00:28:05.767
We didn't fight, so we have nothing to reconcile.

299
00:28:05.850 --> 00:28:09.187
And I don't care about world peace.

300
00:28:11.564 --> 00:28:14.025
There was once a man who loved to eat pork.

301
00:28:14.109 --> 00:28:15.777
For now, let's call him K.

302
00:28:15.860 --> 00:28:17.362
Somehow

303
00:28:17.445 --> 00:28:20.990
K met a very special pig.

304
00:28:21.074 --> 00:28:23.701
Imagine that K falls in love
into this special pig

305
00:28:23.785 --> 00:28:26.037
and then in all the pigs in the world.

306
00:28:28.415 --> 00:28:30.375
Will K become a vegetarian then?

307
00:28:33.670 --> 00:28:34.671
What do you say?

308
00:28:35.255 --> 00:28:38.216
let's work together
to make K a vegetarian.

309
00:28:40.385 --> 00:28:42.804
What a delusion.

310
00:28:45.724 --> 00:28:48.727
She doesn't seem to understand
that world peace is in our hands.

311
00:28:48.810 --> 00:28:51.229
The demon is about to become a guardian.

312
00:28:59.362 --> 00:29:00.447
wait

313
00:29:01.364 --> 00:29:02.615
Let me go with you.

314
00:29:03.992 --> 00:29:05.869
Do not take the wound lightly.

315
00:29:05.952 --> 00:29:07.620
You almost played the box.

316
00:29:07.704 --> 00:29:10.039
So stay home and rest today.

317
00:29:11.624 --> 00:29:13.209
Look what he did to me.

318
00:29:13.293 --> 00:29:15.170
Who knows what he can do to you?

319
00:29:16.337 --> 00:29:19.215
Another guard is waiting for me in the office.

320
00:29:19.299 --> 00:29:20.508
So don't worry and…

321
00:29:20.592 --> 00:29:22.969
No. Now I'm just
I can't trust anyone.

322
00:29:23.052 --> 00:29:25.889
And if that scoundrel comes
as a bodyguard?

323
00:29:25.972 --> 00:29:28.558
I will protect you myself.

324
00:29:29.350 --> 00:29:31.144
stand up

325
00:29:35.607 --> 00:29:38.526
I forbid you.

326
00:29:38.610 --> 00:29:40.153
Who gave you that right?

327
00:29:40.236 --> 00:29:43.615
As your butler I care first
about your safety.

328
00:29:43.698 --> 00:29:47.118
- You won't protect anyone in such a state.
- Then you are fired.

329
00:29:47.202 --> 00:29:50.079
You are no longer my butler
so don't get up and go home.

330
00:29:51.122 --> 00:29:53.750
You are so frivolous
our capitalist friendship?

331
00:29:53.833 --> 00:29:55.502
Do as he says.

332
00:29:55.585 --> 00:29:56.795
Do as I say.

333
00:29:56.878 --> 00:29:59.047
- I am offended!
- Just a little!

334
00:30:00.131 --> 00:30:03.218
Actually, there is a solution.

335
00:30:11.226 --> 00:30:14.521
This car is quite big.
to accommodate us with plenty.

336
00:30:14.604 --> 00:30:15.647
Am I right?

337
00:30:18.525 --> 00:30:21.820
And you don't have to work on the show
instead of following me?

338
00:30:21.903 --> 00:30:23.029
Let's postpone the show.

339
00:30:23.112 --> 00:30:25.365
how do we go on
if you've just been hurt?

340
00:30:25.448 --> 00:30:27.826
I don't quite see the connection here.

341
00:30:27.909 --> 00:30:29.536
A robot like you will not understand.

342
00:30:38.336 --> 00:30:40.296
You need to recharge
at every opportunity.

343
00:30:40.880 --> 00:30:42.465
You said that it is not possible with others.

344
00:30:42.549 --> 00:30:44.300
Now we are officially married.

345
00:30:58.815 --> 00:31:02.110
At the request of an anonymous person

346
00:31:02.193 --> 00:31:03.611
I blamed Ms. To To Hee

347
00:31:03.695 --> 00:31:07.365
in the assassination of Chairman Choo Jung-suk.

348
00:31:07.866 --> 00:31:11.452
<i>I caused Ms. To To Hee a lot of damage.</i>

349
00:31:13.288 --> 00:31:14.372
<i>I sincerely apologize.</i>

350
00:31:14.455 --> 00:31:19.419
You keep a register of articles
and comments by keywords?

351
00:31:19.502 --> 00:31:21.129
- Yes, sir.
- And one more thing

352
00:31:21.212 --> 00:31:24.424
will come with Mr. Chong
general manager of the Sunvol Foundation.

353
00:31:24.507 --> 00:31:26.342
I wonder if the general manager

354
00:31:26.426 --> 00:31:28.303
as handsome as Mr. Jeon.

355
00:31:31.306 --> 00:31:34.100
Be careful, because you will fall into the mirror.

356
00:31:35.643 --> 00:31:36.936
Here they are.

357
00:31:50.116 --> 00:31:51.826
A man with a twisted head?

358
00:31:51.910 --> 00:31:53.578
Yes, that's him.

359
00:31:55.997 --> 00:31:58.875
Sorry about that day.

360
00:32:04.339 --> 00:32:05.506
You scared me!

361
00:32:05.590 --> 00:32:08.343
- I just...
- Everything is fine.

362
00:32:08.426 --> 00:32:11.429
I wanted to celebrate
Mr. Chong's discharge from the hospital.

363
00:32:27.236 --> 00:32:28.363
Is everyone okay?

364
00:32:28.947 --> 00:32:30.782
Is everyone okay?

365
00:32:37.080 --> 00:32:40.458
After yesterday's confession
"Clickbait news"

366
00:32:40.541 --> 00:32:44.128
and an attack on Mr.…
that is, the attack on Director Chon,

367
00:32:44.212 --> 00:32:47.757
public opinion about Mrs. To
has changed radically.

368
00:32:47.840 --> 00:32:52.136
Favorable comments and articles
the two of you are also being talked about.

369
00:32:52.220 --> 00:32:55.598
Those who accused you of murder
now showing sympathy.

370
00:32:55.682 --> 00:32:58.226
That's right. Now they want to know

371
00:32:58.309 --> 00:33:02.522
who tried to destroy you
and kill Mr. Chong.

372
00:33:03.064 --> 00:33:06.818
Now no one will stop you
to run for the post of chairman.

373
00:33:07.402 --> 00:33:11.447
All thanks to Mr. Chong,
who risked his life for Ms. To.

374
00:33:12.657 --> 00:33:13.658
Applause!

375
00:33:16.411 --> 00:33:19.372
Actually, I made you a cake

376
00:33:19.956 --> 00:33:22.917
but did not submit it earlier,
because the firecracker scared you.

377
00:33:23.001 --> 00:33:25.795
What kind of cake? Strawberry? Chocolate?

378
00:33:26.379 --> 00:33:27.255
Yes, yes.

379
00:33:27.338 --> 00:33:30.091
I don't like green tea and whipped cream.

380
00:33:30.174 --> 00:33:32.927
No, he is not from that.
This is a black tea chiffon cake.

381
00:33:33.011 --> 00:33:35.763
- Really?
- One, two

382
00:33:35.847 --> 00:33:37.557
- One, two, three, four
- One, two, three, four

383
00:33:37.640 --> 00:33:40.768
<i>- Congratulations
- Dear director Chona</i>

384
00:33:40.852 --> 00:33:46.399
<i>- Congratulations, dear Mr. Chong
- Congratulations, dear Mr. Cone</i>

385
00:33:46.482 --> 00:33:53.072
<i>- With an extract
- With an extract</i>

386
00:33:54.907 --> 00:33:56.534
Make a wish?

387
00:33:56.617 --> 00:33:58.244
- Of course.
- Yes.

388
00:34:02.623 --> 00:34:03.666
One, two, three.

389
00:34:17.930 --> 00:34:19.640
Sorry.

390
00:34:21.684 --> 00:34:22.727
is everything ok

391
00:34:34.447 --> 00:34:36.324
- What is it?
- What are you talking about?

392
00:34:36.407 --> 00:34:37.784
Why are you so scared?

393
00:34:37.867 --> 00:34:40.411
I have never seen you before
so scared

394
00:34:40.495 --> 00:34:42.580
Me? Frightened?

395
00:34:42.663 --> 00:34:43.998
I am a demon.

396
00:34:44.082 --> 00:34:46.459
Nice try, but don't fool me.

397
00:34:46.542 --> 00:34:50.088
go back to the theater
if you carry the delusion further.

398
00:34:51.089 --> 00:34:52.215
Then as you wish.

399
00:34:53.132 --> 00:34:55.968
I'll tell To To Hee
so that she had to sit for two.

400
00:34:56.969 --> 00:34:59.138
You won't do that.

401
00:34:59.222 --> 00:35:01.474
Then just tell me what's going on.

402
00:35:05.353 --> 00:35:06.479
I had a dream.

403
00:35:07.980 --> 00:35:10.191
I was engulfed in a huge flame,

404
00:35:10.900 --> 00:35:12.568
<i>my whole body was on fire.</i>

405
00:35:13.569 --> 00:35:17.156
i still feel
as the tips of the fingers burned.

406
00:35:18.116 --> 00:35:19.575
It drives me crazy.

407
00:35:21.369 --> 00:35:23.329
Was it spontaneous combustion?

408
00:35:24.747 --> 00:35:26.666
This is what people call it

409
00:35:27.834 --> 00:35:29.085
fear?

410
00:35:30.545 --> 00:35:32.213
Director Chon.

411
00:35:33.005 --> 00:35:34.173
I think

412
00:35:34.966 --> 00:35:37.510
my mind is weakening along with my strength.

413
00:35:39.303 --> 00:35:42.306
When I recover, everything will be back to normal.

414
00:35:50.481 --> 00:35:51.899
I came to see Director Chong.

415
00:35:51.983 --> 00:35:54.235
Now he is gone.

416
00:35:54.819 --> 00:35:56.279
Then I want to see Ms. To.

417
00:35:58.739 --> 00:36:00.032
Please continue.

418
00:36:00.616 --> 00:36:01.450
Thank you.

419
00:36:06.080 --> 00:36:08.416
Ms. Chin Ka-yong has come to see you.

420
00:36:17.049 --> 00:36:19.177
Would you like coffee or tea?

421
00:36:19.260 --> 00:36:20.178
No need.

422
00:36:20.261 --> 00:36:21.888
I didn't come to chat.

423
00:36:23.973 --> 00:36:26.767
Time to use Director Chon,
time to let him go.

424
00:36:26.851 --> 00:36:28.769
We need each other.

425
00:36:28.853 --> 00:36:29.687
Each other?

426
00:36:29.770 --> 00:36:31.355
That is, you need him.

427
00:36:32.273 --> 00:36:35.276
You lead him by the nose
taking advantage of his weakness.

428
00:36:36.235 --> 00:36:38.946
He almost died because of you.

429
00:36:39.030 --> 00:36:41.282
How selfish will you be?

430
00:36:42.742 --> 00:36:45.661
Deal with your problems yourself.

431
00:36:46.787 --> 00:36:49.749
Time to exploit Director Chon
and threaten him dad.

432
00:36:55.546 --> 00:36:57.173
<i>I watched the video from the theater,</i>

433
00:36:58.674 --> 00:37:00.176
and you were right.

434
00:37:00.259 --> 00:37:01.510
The book was stolen.

435
00:37:02.970 --> 00:37:05.848
An hour of video from security cameras was missing
since the evening of the book's disappearance

436
00:37:06.432 --> 00:37:08.142
and from the day you were attacked.

437
00:37:08.226 --> 00:37:12.104
The attacker installed a virus,
to spoil the video at a certain time.

438
00:37:12.188 --> 00:37:13.814
then he knows

439
00:37:15.024 --> 00:37:16.651
who am i

440
00:37:24.367 --> 00:37:25.201
Mr. Chong

441
00:37:25.284 --> 00:37:27.245
Someone was looking for you earlier.

442
00:37:27.328 --> 00:37:28.204
Who?

443
00:37:28.287 --> 00:37:30.498
A tall woman. I don't know who.

444
00:37:33.793 --> 00:37:34.627
Director Chong!

445
00:37:45.012 --> 00:37:48.015
I am glad to see that you are all right.

446
00:37:49.934 --> 00:37:51.060
Thank God.

447
00:38:05.741 --> 00:38:07.159
I will call a taxi.

448
00:38:08.035 --> 00:38:09.620
Go Mr. Paku.

449
00:38:09.704 --> 00:38:11.330
I want to speak to the director.

450
00:38:11.414 --> 00:38:12.623
About what?

451
00:38:12.707 --> 00:38:14.375
Just go, Star Chin.

452
00:38:14.458 --> 00:38:15.584
I'm not for long.

453
00:38:29.432 --> 00:38:32.643
Chula, your powers are flickering.

454
00:38:32.727 --> 00:38:34.061
Don't worry.

455
00:38:34.145 --> 00:38:35.813
Everything will be fine when I get my dad back.

456
00:38:35.896 --> 00:38:38.190
I'm not sure.

457
00:38:39.900 --> 00:38:42.153
The reason why your strength is weakening -
To To Hee.

458
00:38:43.029 --> 00:38:44.071
Everything is wrong.

459
00:38:44.155 --> 00:38:45.656
You want to believe it.

460
00:38:46.407 --> 00:38:48.034
In your heart you know it too.

461
00:38:48.117 --> 00:38:50.578
Everything indicates that the problem is in her.

462
00:38:50.661 --> 00:38:52.413
You can't avoid it.

463
00:38:53.039 --> 00:38:54.457
Is she special to you now?

464
00:38:59.378 --> 00:39:01.714
She sits down
do you have a special place in your heart?

465
00:39:08.763 --> 00:39:10.514
You are becoming more and more human,

466
00:39:10.598 --> 00:39:13.392
because through it you experience human emotions.

467
00:39:14.727 --> 00:39:15.686
Because you...

468
00:39:19.315 --> 00:39:20.483
in love with her

469
00:39:23.778 --> 00:39:26.572
Love is the pinnacle of humanity.

470
00:39:27.323 --> 00:39:29.533
- Stop.
- You have to stop.

471
00:39:29.617 --> 00:39:31.160
If you're a demon, behave yourself!

472
00:39:33.079 --> 00:39:34.497
Didn't you say it yourself

473
00:39:34.580 --> 00:39:37.041
that people are unimportant and weak?

474
00:39:40.503 --> 00:39:41.837
Do you want to become one?

475
00:39:47.510 --> 00:39:48.844
You have to stop.

476
00:39:50.262 --> 00:39:51.514
If you don't stop,

477
00:39:53.641 --> 00:39:55.059
it will not end there.

478
00:40:14.578 --> 00:40:15.996
Want to listen to music?

479
00:40:17.581 --> 00:40:18.582
No, thank you.

480
00:40:19.458 --> 00:40:20.292
Of course.

481
00:40:21.752 --> 00:40:25.381
Did Ka Yeon say something stupid to you?

482
00:40:27.758 --> 00:40:29.009
But no.

483
00:40:30.136 --> 00:40:33.222
She just invited me to her show.

484
00:40:35.182 --> 00:40:37.101
Did she say something to you?

485
00:40:39.854 --> 00:40:40.896
No.

486
00:40:44.483 --> 00:40:46.110
Please come to the show.

487
00:40:46.193 --> 00:40:48.654
While it is postponed, it is not for long.

488
00:40:48.737 --> 00:40:50.030
Swords will whistle in the air.

489
00:40:51.031 --> 00:40:51.866
I will come

490
00:40:55.786 --> 00:40:58.289
It must have shocked Ms. Chin that
what happened to you

491
00:41:01.625 --> 00:41:03.836
I felt how much you care about her.

492
00:41:52.885 --> 00:41:54.053
Ms. Chu.

493
00:41:55.930 --> 00:41:56.889
to me

494
00:41:57.973 --> 00:42:00.059
continue to go forward?

495
00:42:02.353 --> 00:42:04.939
Jung Ku Won almost died because of me

496
00:42:06.524 --> 00:42:08.734
although he is not involved in any way
to this struggle.

497
00:42:10.986 --> 00:42:13.656
I don't know if I should go any further

498
00:42:14.156 --> 00:42:15.658
at the expense of other people.

499
00:42:17.493 --> 00:42:18.494
But...

500
00:42:19.787 --> 00:42:21.497
if i give up here

501
00:42:25.167 --> 00:42:27.294
it will be unfair to you.

502
00:42:31.507 --> 00:42:33.884
Don't worry about the dead.

503
00:42:34.802 --> 00:42:36.887
I'm just worried it's getting to you.

504
00:42:38.556 --> 00:42:39.723
It gets me.

505
00:42:41.225 --> 00:42:42.851
It got to me so much, I'm upset.

506
00:42:45.771 --> 00:42:47.523
I lost my dear family

507
00:42:49.149 --> 00:42:51.026
and I don't even know whose fault it is.

508
00:42:59.702 --> 00:43:01.787
But now you have a new family.

509
00:43:03.622 --> 00:43:05.708
Don't lose your new family

510
00:43:06.875 --> 00:43:08.586
because of the one that is no longer there.

511
00:43:11.213 --> 00:43:12.256
However...

512
00:43:17.136 --> 00:43:19.054
Do as you like.

513
00:43:21.390 --> 00:43:22.933
To do as is best for me?

514
00:43:24.018 --> 00:43:26.353
Yes, how better for the one you love

515
00:43:27.521 --> 00:43:29.273
better for you too.

516
00:43:33.777 --> 00:43:35.070
What about you then?

517
00:43:37.948 --> 00:43:39.783
What is better for you?

518
00:43:44.788 --> 00:43:46.457
What is best for you…

519
00:43:48.709 --> 00:43:50.210
better for me too.

520
00:44:20.407 --> 00:44:21.325
Sok Hune.

521
00:44:23.035 --> 00:44:24.453
I have to talk to you.

522
00:44:46.350 --> 00:44:47.434
is everything ok

523
00:44:48.394 --> 00:44:49.228
are you hurt

524
00:44:50.229 --> 00:44:51.271
Everything is fine.

525
00:44:51.355 --> 00:44:52.940
Did you take painkillers?

526
00:44:53.023 --> 00:44:54.191
I don't need them.

527
00:44:54.274 --> 00:44:56.610
I feel great because I recharged.

528
00:44:59.488 --> 00:45:00.948
It's time for us to get to work.

529
00:45:17.214 --> 00:45:18.132
Mr. Chong

530
00:45:21.635 --> 00:45:23.178
I heard you got hurt.

531
00:45:23.262 --> 00:45:25.389
I saw in the news that you were attacked.

532
00:45:25.472 --> 00:45:27.558
Don't believe everything you see in the news.

533
00:45:27.641 --> 00:45:29.768
There they even accused an innocent woman of murder.

534
00:45:31.395 --> 00:45:32.229
Let's go inside.

535
00:45:34.648 --> 00:45:36.275
Run if you want to live.

536
00:45:40.279 --> 00:45:42.573
Everyone around To To Hee dies.

537
00:45:49.163 --> 00:45:50.414
Go beat him?

538
00:45:52.708 --> 00:45:54.585
Even I can beat him to a pulp.

539
00:45:56.211 --> 00:45:57.337
Ignore him.

540
00:46:09.558 --> 00:46:12.060
I don't think Seok Hoon will be able to come.

541
00:46:12.144 --> 00:46:15.814
Loyal supporter of To To Hee
will definitely not miss this meeting.

542
00:46:15.898 --> 00:46:17.816
He must be planning to be late again.

543
00:46:20.194 --> 00:46:22.362
Let's begin the special meeting of the board of directors.

544
00:46:22.863 --> 00:46:26.033
Today we will vote for the applicants

545
00:46:26.116 --> 00:46:28.660
to the position of chairman of "Mire Group".

546
00:46:28.744 --> 00:46:30.204
I want to announce something.

547
00:46:30.287 --> 00:46:32.956
Each candidate then
will have a chance to make a speech.

548
00:46:33.040 --> 00:46:35.542
This is an important statement about voting.

549
00:46:36.585 --> 00:46:38.670
OK, please.

550
00:46:43.634 --> 00:46:46.845
To prevent further
conflicts and disputes,

551
00:46:48.096 --> 00:46:50.265
I withdraw my candidacy.

552
00:46:52.935 --> 00:46:55.521
What game has she started now?

553
00:47:00.442 --> 00:47:01.276
We need to talk.

554
00:47:02.152 --> 00:47:02.986
Then.

555
00:47:04.112 --> 00:47:08.116
Then let's vote
whether to suggest Mr. No Suk Min

556
00:47:08.200 --> 00:47:10.536
as the only candidate for the post of chairman

557
00:47:10.619 --> 00:47:12.412
at the shareholders' meeting.

558
00:47:20.379 --> 00:47:23.090
FOR, AGAINST, ABSENT

559
00:47:30.764 --> 00:47:32.224
What are you doing in your own way?

560
00:47:33.517 --> 00:47:34.601
Let's talk outside.

561
00:47:36.979 --> 00:47:38.397
You made a difficult decision.

562
00:47:39.273 --> 00:47:40.274
I appreciate it.

563
00:47:40.857 --> 00:47:42.025
What game are you playing?

564
00:47:46.655 --> 00:47:48.490
I decided to forgive and forget.

565
00:47:49.074 --> 00:47:51.743
And I will refuse the inheritance.

566
00:47:52.828 --> 00:47:54.162
So let's put an end to it

567
00:47:55.497 --> 00:47:57.040
this war

568
00:48:03.547 --> 00:48:06.717
I'm glad you finally did
made the right decision.

569
00:48:10.596 --> 00:48:11.638
Well done.

570
00:48:33.619 --> 00:48:35.454
Explain to me why you do this.

571
00:48:41.668 --> 00:48:43.086
I am tired of all this.

572
00:48:44.296 --> 00:48:45.422
Is this the thing?

573
00:48:45.505 --> 00:48:48.258
I can no longer live on my nerves and in fear.

574
00:48:48.342 --> 00:48:51.178
I can't even go by myself
to work or for a walk.

575
00:48:52.179 --> 00:48:54.389
I want to live peacefully like everyone else

576
00:48:54.473 --> 00:48:56.642
and return to normal life.

577
00:48:58.268 --> 00:49:00.479
Therefore, I got rid of the reason,
from which I was hunted.

578
00:49:00.562 --> 00:49:01.396
No.

579
00:49:02.397 --> 00:49:03.357
you are lying

580
00:49:04.441 --> 00:49:06.109
Look into my eyes.

581
00:49:07.235 --> 00:49:08.570
And tell me the truth.

582
00:49:19.414 --> 00:49:20.916
I can't trust you anymore.

583
00:49:22.376 --> 00:49:23.418
What?

584
00:49:24.419 --> 00:49:26.421
You can't protect me anymore.

585
00:49:27.881 --> 00:49:29.883
You've become so weak

586
00:49:31.176 --> 00:49:32.886
that you can't even protect yourself.

587
00:49:39.685 --> 00:49:41.103
Are you satisfied with the answer?

588
00:50:52.966 --> 00:50:53.967
No…

589
00:50:55.719 --> 00:50:57.304
Why hasn't he come yet?

590
00:50:57.387 --> 00:50:58.638
Why?

591
00:51:12.611 --> 00:51:14.613
<i>There is something wrong with his powers.</i>

592
00:51:33.548 --> 00:51:34.966
What is she thinking?

593
00:51:35.592 --> 00:51:37.219
What will she do next?

594
00:51:37.302 --> 00:51:40.931
This time she caught me by surprise.

595
00:51:41.014 --> 00:51:42.849
Maybe she just gave up.

596
00:51:43.683 --> 00:51:46.895
After all, she's too young
to cope with everything that fell on her.

597
00:51:46.978 --> 00:51:50.232
As I have said many times,
she is not like that.

598
00:51:50.315 --> 00:51:53.068
I'm sure she wants to
lull our vigilance

599
00:51:53.151 --> 00:51:55.320
to stab us in the back.

600
00:51:56.988 --> 00:51:58.490
Her bodyguard was recently attacked.

601
00:51:59.699 --> 00:52:01.076
It probably scared her.

602
00:52:01.159 --> 00:52:03.453
It can't be. She was not attacked.

603
00:52:03.537 --> 00:52:06.540
She is not one to back down
even at gunpoint.

604
00:52:06.623 --> 00:52:09.167
Whatever the reason, glad
that she understood her position

605
00:52:09.251 --> 00:52:10.252
and gave up.

606
00:52:13.880 --> 00:52:15.131
Great, dear.

607
00:52:15.715 --> 00:52:17.384
He is not the head yet.

608
00:52:17.884 --> 00:52:19.511
Isn't it too early for a toast?

609
00:52:22.013 --> 00:52:23.056
Is that Kone?

610
00:52:23.974 --> 00:52:26.685
- Thank you for the food.
- Sit until everyone has finished eating.

611
00:52:26.768 --> 00:52:27.727
I have plans.

612
00:52:32.232 --> 00:52:33.525
But To Kyone.

613
00:52:34.276 --> 00:52:35.485
Sit back immediately.

614
00:52:51.251 --> 00:52:52.085
Shall we continue?

615
00:53:09.436 --> 00:53:11.521
Open the door, Director Jon!

616
00:53:13.231 --> 00:53:14.733
Director Chong!

617
00:53:17.402 --> 00:53:19.279
<i>You can no longer protect me.</i>

618
00:53:21.656 --> 00:53:23.825
<i>You have become so weak,</i>

619
00:53:24.784 --> 00:53:26.494
that you can't even protect yourself.

620
00:53:46.431 --> 00:53:48.099
<i>That is, you need him.</i>

621
00:53:48.600 --> 00:53:51.978
<i>You lead him by the nose,
taking advantage of his weakness.</i>

622
00:53:52.062 --> 00:53:54.356
He almost died because of you.

623
00:53:55.023 --> 00:53:57.442
<i>What kind of egoist will you be?</i>

624
00:53:57.525 --> 00:53:59.110
Run if you want to live.

625
00:53:59.861 --> 00:54:01.988
Everyone around To To Hee dies.

626
00:54:10.664 --> 00:54:12.707
RESULTS OF THE SPECIAL MEETING
BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF "MIRE GROUP"

627
00:54:12.791 --> 00:54:15.669
CEO NO SOOK MIN -
THE ONLY CANDIDATE FOR THE POSITION OF THE CHAIRMAN

628
00:54:21.967 --> 00:54:24.469
<i>I will give up, Seok Hoon.</i>

629
00:54:25.553 --> 00:54:28.014
I will withdraw my candidacy tomorrow.

630
00:54:28.640 --> 00:54:29.641
To Hee

631
00:54:29.724 --> 00:54:32.435
I did everything I could.
Ms. Chu would definitely understand.

632
00:54:33.937 --> 00:54:36.856
Even if we catch the intruder,
it won't bring her back.

633
00:54:40.860 --> 00:54:43.446
I think I just had to
to vent anger on something

634
00:54:43.530 --> 00:54:45.407
after the loss of Ms. Chu.

635
00:54:47.158 --> 00:54:48.994
Therefore, I could not leave it.

636
00:54:50.954 --> 00:54:52.247
when i leave it

637
00:54:53.707 --> 00:54:55.041
everyone will be happy.

638
00:54:56.501 --> 00:54:57.961
You do it

639
00:54:59.087 --> 00:55:00.922
for Mr. Chong's sake?

640
00:55:02.924 --> 00:55:05.885
Because you don't want him to get hurt again?

641
00:55:10.932 --> 00:55:14.519
I don't want to lose the one again
who is dear to me

642
00:55:34.664 --> 00:55:36.499
You knew everything, right?

643
00:55:36.583 --> 00:55:37.876
what happened

644
00:55:38.376 --> 00:55:40.045
She definitely told you everything.

645
00:55:40.128 --> 00:55:41.546
Why did she suddenly give up?

646
00:55:42.338 --> 00:55:44.382
If you're so curious, ask her yourself.

647
00:55:44.466 --> 00:55:46.134
She won't tell me anything!

648
00:55:48.136 --> 00:55:49.763
didn't you tell me

649
00:55:49.846 --> 00:55:51.973
that she has her own reasons for not telling?

650
00:55:53.099 --> 00:55:56.436
You should have talked her out of it anyway.

651
00:55:56.519 --> 00:55:59.481
You know how important it is to her
find Choo Jung Suk's killer?

652
00:55:59.564 --> 00:56:02.150
I know that. I know it very well!

653
00:56:04.110 --> 00:56:05.320
To Hee always

654
00:56:06.112 --> 00:56:08.698
blamed herself for the death of her parents.

655
00:56:08.782 --> 00:56:11.242
Now she will blame herself
and in the death of my aunt

656
00:56:11.326 --> 00:56:13.119
through you!

657
00:56:14.954 --> 00:56:15.955
What?

658
00:56:16.039 --> 00:56:17.791
She gave up because of you.

659
00:56:20.001 --> 00:56:21.753
I didn't want you to get hurt again.

660
00:56:28.259 --> 00:56:29.094
To To Hee!

661
00:56:51.616 --> 00:56:53.535
SAVIOR KU WON

662
00:57:14.347 --> 00:57:15.640
All the flowers have fallen.

663
00:57:25.108 --> 00:57:26.025
Ms. Chu.

664
00:57:30.572 --> 00:57:32.282
you never saw

665
00:57:33.575 --> 00:57:35.285
as your precious flowers bear fruit.

666
00:57:38.079 --> 00:57:39.456
Are you really all right?

667
00:57:44.127 --> 00:57:45.336
I'm sorry, Ms. Chu.

668
00:57:51.801 --> 00:57:53.094
I'm so sorry.

669
00:58:09.402 --> 00:58:10.778
Let's go back.

670
00:58:12.447 --> 00:58:13.990
If you give up because of me

671
00:58:15.033 --> 00:58:16.117
let's go back and fight again.

672
00:58:19.913 --> 00:58:21.039
Everything is wrong.

673
00:58:21.998 --> 00:58:22.916
To To Hee.

674
00:58:23.625 --> 00:58:25.251
Do as you like.

675
00:58:29.631 --> 00:58:31.257
Because it's better for me.

676
00:58:41.351 --> 00:58:42.477
They are all dead.

677
00:58:44.395 --> 00:58:45.897
Ms. Chu,

678
00:58:45.980 --> 00:58:47.232
mom and dad

679
00:58:48.316 --> 00:58:50.318
Everyone I loved in my life is dead.

680
00:58:54.572 --> 00:58:55.698
And you will die too...

681
00:59:00.036 --> 00:59:01.287
through me

682
00:59:06.918 --> 00:59:08.044
I don't care.

683
01:00:23.244 --> 01:00:25.288
<i>Even if my feelings are for you</i>

684
01:00:25.371 --> 01:00:28.499
<i>make me insignificant and weak,</i>

685
01:00:30.710 --> 01:00:31.794
<i>you are my destiny,</i>

686
01:00:33.671 --> 01:00:35.006
<i>which I cannot resist.</i>

687
01:00:43.264 --> 01:00:45.933
MY BELOVED DEMON

688
01:01:37.568 --> 01:01:40.279
{\an8}<i>What is better for you
became what is best for me.</i>

689
01:01:40.363 --> 01:01:42.448
{\an8}<i>There is no way I will back down from To To Hee.</i>

690
01:01:43.032 --> 01:01:44.826
{\an8}Man, ride me on your back.

691
01:01:44.909 --> 01:01:46.869
{\an8}I feel so free and happy.

692
01:01:46.953 --> 01:01:47.995
{\an8}<i>Call yourselves Wild Dogs?</i>

693
01:01:48.079 --> 01:01:49.038
{\an8}I have a task for you.

694
01:01:49.122 --> 01:01:50.248
{\an8}<i>If you do not comply,</i>

695
01:01:50.331 --> 01:01:52.583
{\an8}<i>forbid you to appear before my eyes.</i>

696
01:01:52.667 --> 01:01:53.835
{\an8}- Forward!
- Forward!

697
01:01:53.918 --> 01:01:55.712
{\an8}- Yes, detective?
<i>- We found the culprit, Mrs. To.</i>

698
01:01:55.795 --> 01:01:56.838
{\an8}<i>His name is Ki Kwang Chul.</i>

699
01:01:56.921 --> 01:01:59.090
{\an8}<i>We are looking for him, so we will find him soon.</i>

700
01:01:59.173 --> 01:02:00.591
{\an8}The game of hide and seek is over.

701
01:02:00.675 --> 01:02:03.010
{\an8}<i>Clocks. They stopped.</i>

702
01:02:03.094 --> 01:02:05.430
{\an8}<i>My powers didn't just flicker.</i>

703
01:02:05.513 --> 01:02:07.140
{\an8}<i>They are completely gone.</i>

704
01:02:09.767 --> 01:02:14.772
Translation of subtitles: Daria Hochel

